## Workflow Reference
Implements: ai_toolkit/workflows/maintenance/bugfix.md

# Bugfix

**Follow the workflow file verbatim.**

## Args

```text
<feature|plan-path> [phase|next] [+tag -tag] [--load=a,b] [--full] [--commit]
```

Slug or `ai_specs/fixes/<folder>/`. Tags = suspected domain. **Commit:** false unless `--commit`. `--no-persist` skips the fix folder (discouraged). `--no-commits` = default.

Phrases: `bugfix: …` (chat), `bugfix from tester report`, `bugfix from ai_specs/fixes/<slug>/`.

## Load (once; no INDEX.md)

1. `ai_toolkit/workflows/maintenance/bugfix.md`
2. `ai_toolkit/LOADMAP.md` cards for tags / `--load=` / `--full`
3. Fix folder when resuming; feature README Contract if a slug is named
4. `ai_docs/memory.md` once before replacing an app-wide gotcha
5. Screen file before Figma if visual

Lite bootstrap. Read-once. Broad search → `explore` subagent. Skip tests. Analyzer on touched files. Handoff ≤10 lines with Context used.

Intake → reproduce → isolate → minimal fix → verify → write README + `request.md`. App-wide gotcha: replace the matching row in `ai_docs/memory.md` (≤ 4 KB). Do not append. Feature-only notes stay out of that file.
